#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.resource_matter_thread
msgid ""
"A mesh depends on the roles of its devices, their placement and power, and "
"the route to the internet. Coverage depends on the building, placement and "
"radio conditions, so plan it for the site and check it after installation. "
"When the route to the internet is lost, remote management waits for it to "
"return; read"
msgstr ""
"Una malla depende de los roles de sus dispositivos, de su ubicación y "
