msgid ""
"SmartphoneKey goes beyond the limits of traditional keys, offering a safe, "
"convenient, and modern approach to property access. With <strong>non-"
"copyable key cards</strong> and <strong>secure digital keys</strong> "
"integrated into <strong>Apple and Google Wallets</strong>, SmartphoneKey "
"enhances security for every property type. For anyone looking to upgrade "
"their access control system, now is the perfect time to choose SmartphoneKey"
" and experience a safer, smarter way to protect your property."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_how_smartphonekey_enhances_security_for_your_property
msgid ""
"SmartphoneKey has been designed with various users in mind, from property "
"managers to homeowners and business owners. Here are a few scenarios "
"illustrating how SmartphoneKey provides superior security for different "
"needs:"
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:spk_website_v2.page_platform
msgid ""
"SmartphoneKey is an access management platform. Administrators manage sites "
"and access in the Admin Panel. Residents and staff enter with a digital key "
"or a card; visitors scan the entrance QR code to contact a resident or the "
"site team. Readers at the doors apply each change and report what happened."
msgstr ""
"SmartphoneKey es una plataforma de gestión de accesos. Los administradores "
"gestionan los sitios y el acceso en el Admin Panel. Residentes y personal "
"entran con una llave digital o una tarjeta; los visitantes escanean el "
"código QR de la entrada para contactar con un residente o con el equipo del "
"sitio. Los lectores de las puertas aplican cada cambio y notifican lo que ha"
" ocurrido."

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:spk_website_v2.page_platform
msgid ""
"SmartphoneKey is an access management platform. It combines the Admin Panel,"
" Wallet keys and NFC cards, SmartphoneKey readers with a built-in access "
"controller, and connected-device scenarios, so teams can manage access "
"across their sites."
msgstr ""
"SmartphoneKey es una plataforma de gestión de accesos. Reúne el Admin Panel,"
" las llaves en Wallet y las tarjetas NFC, los lectores SmartphoneKey con "
"controlador de acceso integrado y los escenarios de dispositivos conectados,"
" para que los equipos gestionen el acceso en todos sus sitios."

